      "side": 1,
      "message": "A few issues:\n\n1) This shouldn\u0027t be marked SystemApi.Client.SYSTEM_SERVER since it\u0027s in the boot class path for apps. Only things that are in the system_server BCP but not in the app BCP should be in this API set. In fact, this shouldn\u0027t be @SystemApi at all since all the existing variants are public API.\n\n2) We\u0027re trying to avoid adding new *AsUser APIs, hence the deprecation. Instead, use Context#createPackageContextAsUser to obtain a new Context and then call whatever methods you need to. \n\n3) APIs cannot be new *and* deprecated outside of exceptional circumstances.",
      "revId": "2bb203234e64725bff4a7e480db8912b333b648a",
